mutation track the waiting browser callback under the previous attempt number
detects TypeOK
only one attempt
-           /\ pending' = IF phase = "idle" THEN pending ELSE pending \cup {Token(sequence', phase)}
+           /\ pending' = IF phase = "idle" THEN pending ELSE pending \cup {Token(sequence, phase)}

mutation leave the action locked when a timeout changes its notice
detects DeadlineUnlocks
only one attempt
-     /\ view' = End(TimeoutNotice, view.plan, FALSE)
+     /\ view' = [view EXCEPT !.notice = TimeoutNotice]

mutation send a reservation after the abandoned browser callback completes
detects LateCannotChange
only one attempt
-     /\ UNCHANGED <<sequence, view, sent, expired>>
+     /\ sent' = sent \cup {callback.id}
+     /\ UNCHANGED <<sequence, view, expired>>

mutation send a reservation while worker registration has still to finish
detects WriteAfterPreflight
only one attempt
-           /\ sent' = IF phase = "server" /\ view.kind = "write" THEN sent \cup {sequence} ELSE sent
+           /\ sent' = IF view.kind = "write" THEN sent \cup {sequence} ELSE sent

mutation clear the previous reservation when a later lookup or reservation times out
detects FailurePreservesPlan
only two attempts
-     /\ view' = End(TimeoutNotice, view.plan, FALSE)
+     /\ view' = End(TimeoutNotice, FALSE, FALSE)

mutation present an ambiguous timeout as confirmed
detects FailurePreservesPlan
only one attempt
-     /\ view' = End(TimeoutNotice, view.plan, FALSE)
+     /\ view' = End(TimeoutNotice, view.plan, TRUE)

mutation hide the lookup advice after the server write outcome is unknown
detects UnconfirmedWriteNeedsLookup
only one attempt
- ServerFailure == IF view.kind = "write" \/ view.notice = "writeUnknown" THEN "writeUnknown" ELSE "readUnknown"
+ ServerFailure == "readUnknown"

mutation classify an unanswered permission prompt as an explicit denial
detects PermissionTimeoutDistinct
only one attempt
- TimeoutNotice == CASE view.phase = "permission" -> "permissionTimeout"
+ TimeoutNotice == CASE view.phase = "permission" -> "denied"

mutation register no expiry timer for a pending permission request
detects AttemptReturns
only one attempt
- Expire ==
-     /\ Waiting
+ Expire ==
+     /\ Waiting /\ view.phase # "permission"

mutation erase the ambiguous write notice if device lookup times out
detects UnconfirmedWriteSurvivesFailedLookup
only two attempts
-                    [] view.kind = "read" -> IF view.notice = "writeUnknown" THEN "writeUnknown" ELSE "lookupTimeout"
+                    [] view.kind = "read" -> "lookupTimeout"
